\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Audited weighted mean-$N=5$ reconstructions nearest the 10th, 50th, and 90th percentiles of held-out-cohort SSIM. Columns show voided input, reconstruction, ground truth, and absolute error after official normalization. Cyan outlines the complete inpainting hole; dashed yellow outlines the healthy region used for scoring. The error map is shown only in that healthy region with one pooled 99th-percentile-clipped scale. Each row uses its own source-derived intensity window and the maximum-healthy-mask-area axial slice.}}{8}{figure.3}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:qualitative-reconstructions}{{3}{8}{Audited weighted mean-$N=5$ reconstructions nearest the 10th, 50th, and 90th percentiles of held-out-cohort SSIM. Columns show voided input, reconstruction, ground truth, and absolute error after official normalization. Cyan outlines the complete inpainting hole; dashed yellow outlines the healthy region used for scoring. The error map is shown only in that healthy region with one pooled 99th-percentile-clipped scale. Each row uses its own source-derived intensity window and the maximum-healthy-mask-area axial slice}{figure.3}{}}
